stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_parse: parse request(start_slot, count)
    q_parse --> q_compute_range: range = [min(current_epoch - MIN_EPOCHS_BLOB, FULU_FORK_EPOCH), FULU_FORK_EPOCH)
    q_compute_range --> q_check_overlap: check requested range overlaps transition range
    q_check_overlap --> q_respond_empty: range entirely at or after FULU_FORK_EPOCH / MAY return empty
    q_check_overlap --> q_respond_sidecars: range includes pre-Fulu epochs
    q_respond_sidecars --> [*]: return blob sidecars from transition range
    q_respond_empty --> [*]: return empty list
